              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wanteth not liquor: thy belly",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is like",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "an heap of wheat set about with lilies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy two breasts",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "like two young roes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "twins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy neck",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as a tower of ivory; thine eyes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "like",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the fishpools in Heshbon, by the gate of Bath-rabbim: thy nose",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as the tower of Lebanon which looketh toward Damascus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thine head upon thee",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "like Carmel, and the hair of thine head like purple; the king",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "held in the galleries.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How fair and how pleasant art thou, O love, for delights!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This thy stature is like to a palm tree, and thy breasts to clusters",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "of grapes",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I said, I will go up to the palm tree, I will take hold of the boughs thereof: now also thy breasts shall be as clusters of the vine, and the smell of thy nose like apples;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the roof of thy mouth like the best wine for my beloved, that goeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "down",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sweetly, causing the lips of those that are asleep to speak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
