            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my beloved's, and his desire",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "toward me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come, my beloved, let us go forth into the field; let us lodge in the villages.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us get up early to the vineyards; let us see if the vine flourish,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "whether",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the tender grape appear,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the pomegranates bud forth: there will I give thee my loves.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The mandrakes give a smell, and at our gates",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all manner of pleasant",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "fruits",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", new and old,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "SNG.7.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "SNG.7.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have laid up for thee, O my beloved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
